======
RULES
======
[ action Player ] -> [ Player ]
[ moving Player ] -> [ moving Player Trail ]
[ > Player | Light ] -> [ Player | Light ]
late [ Player Trail ] -> cancel
late [ Trail ] -> [ ]
late [ Pulse ] -> [ ]
late [ Player Dark ] -> [ Player Light ]
late [ Player ] -> [ Player Trapped ]
late [ Player | Dark ] -> [ Player no Trapped | Dark ]

==============
WINCONDITIONS
==============

no Dark

